    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438700/extras/46bee18a8f69be4465d70153604275b3.avif?t=1753934863\" width=610 height=150 /></span><br>Elf World Adventure 5 is the continuation of an H-game in the anime and puzzle genres, immersing you in a captivating world inspired by samurai aesthetics. You'll enjoy many new levels where you collect images of beautiful elf girls dressed in exquisite outfits.<br><br>Dive into a magical atmosphere of Eastern culture accompanied by relaxing melodic music. This game will delight you not only with engaging and challenging puzzles but also with numerous achievements that will decorate your Steam profile and highlight your successes in the elf world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438700/extras/498deb936765d2d5ae0cddc10223653c.avif?t=1753934863\" width=610 height=150 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hentai Experience: Enjoy a game that combines puzzles with hentai elements.<br></li><li>Samurai Atmosphere: Immerse yourself in a magical world of Eastern culture with elegant music.<br></li><li>Beautiful Elf Girls: Discover stunning images of elf girls in samurai-style attire.<br></li><li>Casual Gameplay: Simple controls and an accessible interface suitable for everyone.<br></li><li>Many Levels: Challenge yourself across numerous new levels.</li></ul>",
